{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Here's a Shopify AI prompt optimized for the **latest Shopify Horizon AI** theme that closely matches the UI in your screenshot while adding **multiple testimonials with left/right navigation arrows**.
    
    ---
    
    ### Shopify AI Prompt
    
    > Create a premium, modern testimonial and company introduction section with a two-column layout on a full-width dark background (#0B0B0D). The content should be centered inside a max-width container of approximately 1320px with 32px horizontal padding and 24px gap between the two cards.
    >
    > **Desktop Layout**
    >
    > * Two equal-width cards with large rounded corners (28px radius).
    > * Cards should have equal height.
    > * Add subtle shadows and soft gradients for depth.
    > * Cards should stack vertically on mobile.
    >
    > **Left Card (Company Intro)**
    >
    > * Background: very dark charcoal (#111111) with a subtle navy gradient glow in the upper-right corner.
    >
    > * Internal padding: 48px.
    >
    > * Small pill badge at the top reading "Technology".
    >
    >   * Height: 34px
    >   * Border radius: 999px
    >   * Thin border with low-opacity white
    >   * Small blue sparkle icon before the text.
    >
    > * Large heading:
    >
    >   Building high-performance Shopify experiences with **AI-driven innovation**
    >
    > * Highlight only "AI-driven innovation" using a vibrant orange (#FF7A1A).
    >
    > * Font size around 58px desktop, bold, tight line height.
    >
    > * White heading color.
    >
    > * Below the heading add supporting paragraph:
    >
    >   We combine Shopify expertise, intelligent automation, and scalable engineering to help brands launch faster, convert more customers, and grow with confidence.
    >
    > * Paragraph width around 520px.
    >
    > * Color: rgba(255,255,255,.55)
    >
    > * Font size 18px.
    >
    > * Bottom statistics row:
    >
    > Left statistic
    >
    > * 150+
    > * Shopify Projects Delivered
    >
    > Right statistic
    >
    > * 98%
    > * Client Satisfaction Rate
    >
    > Numbers:
    >
    > * Orange (#FF7A1A)
    > * 48px bold
    >
    > Labels:
    >
    > * 16px
    > * Light gray
    >
    > Statistics should be spaced evenly.
    >
    > ---
    >
    > **Right Card (Testimonials Slider)**
    >
    > * Background: deep navy (#041D38).
    > * Rounded corners: 28px.
    > * Padding: 48px.
    >
    > Add a testimonial carousel that supports unlimited reviews.
    >
    > At the top-right place a large outlined quotation mark icon in blue.
    >
    > Testimonial Header:
    >
    > * Circular customer image (64x64).
    > * Customer name in bold white.
    > * Position/company underneath in smaller muted gray text.
    >
    > Testimonial body:
    >
    > * Large italic text.
    > * Color: rgba(255,255,255,.82)
    > * Comfortable line-height.
    > * Maximum width around 520px.
    >
    > Below the testimonial add:
    >
    > **Navigation Controls**
    >
    > * Circular left arrow button.
    > * Circular right arrow button.
    > * Position them centered horizontally at the bottom OR vertically centered outside the testimonial card.
    > * Use semi-transparent dark buttons with subtle border.
    > * On hover:
    >
    >   * background changes to orange (#FF7A1A)
    >   * arrow becomes white
    >   * smooth 250ms transition.
    >
    > Make the carousel slide smoothly between testimonials with fade + horizontal movement.
    >
    > Auto-play every 5 seconds.
    >
    > Pause autoplay on hover.
    >
    > Swipe support on mobile.
    >
    > ---
    >
    > **Design Style**
    >
    > * Apple-inspired premium interface.
    > * Minimal.
    > * Clean spacing.
    > * Large typography.
    > * Soft gradients only.
    > * No heavy borders.
    > * Elegant shadows.
    > * Excellent visual hierarchy.
    > * Plenty of breathing room.
    >
    > ---
    >
    > **Typography**
    >
    > * Headings: Inter Bold
    > * Body: Inter Regular
    > * Numbers: Inter ExtraBold
    > * Testimonial: Inter Italic
    >
    > ---
    >
    > **Animations**
    >
    > * Fade-up animation when section enters viewport.
    > * Counter animation for statistics.
    > * Smooth hover effects on cards.
    > * Carousel slide animation.
    > * Arrow hover animation.
    >
    > ---
    >
    > **Responsive**
    >
    > * Desktop: 2-column layout.
    > * Tablet: 2 columns with reduced spacing.
    > * Mobile:
    >
    >   * Cards stack vertically.
    >   * Heading scales to 36px.
    >   * Statistics become two equal columns.
    >   * Navigation arrows remain below the testimonial.
    >   * Proper spacing for touch interaction.
    >
    > ---
    >
    > **Section Settings**
    >
    > * Editable technology badge.
    > * Editable heading with highlighted text.
    > * Editable description.
    > * Editable statistics (number + label).
    > * Unlimited testimonial blocks.
    > * Customer image picker.
    > * Customer name.
    > * Customer designation.
    > * Company name.
    > * Review text.
    > * Enable/disable autoplay.
    > * Autoplay speed.
    > * Show/hide navigation arrows.
    > * Show/hide quotation icon.
    > * Background colors for both cards.
    > * Corner radius.
    > * Section top and bottom spacing.
    >
    > The final result should closely match the provided design reference, with pixel-accurate spacing, premium typography, dark luxury styling, and a fully functional testimonial carousel featuring left and right navigation arrows while preserving the clean, modern aesthetic.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-testimonial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 32px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-company-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.company_card_background }};
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-company-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    right: -20%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 61, 120, 0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-company-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-badge-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-company-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .ai-company-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .highlight {
    color: {{ block.settings.highlight_color }};
  }

  .ai-company-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ai-stat-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.stat_number_size }}px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_number_color }};
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.stat_label_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_label_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.testimonial_card_background }};
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-quote-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 48px;
    right: 48px;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    color: {{ block.settings.quote_icon_color }};
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .ai-testimonial-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-width: 100%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-customer-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-customer-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-customer-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-customer-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-customer-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.customer_name_color }};
  }

  .ai-customer-position-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.customer_position_color }};
  }

  .ai-testimonial-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.testimonial_text_size }}px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: {{ block.settings.testimonial_text_color }};
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-navigation-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .ai-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.nav_button_hover_bg }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.nav_button_hover_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.nav_button_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-testimonial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-company-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px;
    }

    .ai-quote-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 32px;
      right: 32px;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-testimonial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 16px;
      padding-right: 16px;
    }

    .ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ai-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<testimonial-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-testimonial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-testimonial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-company-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-company-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg class="ai-badge-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
            </svg>
            {{ block.settings.badge_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <h2 class="ai-company-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.heading_before_highlight }}
          {% if block.settings.heading_highlight != blank %}
            <span class="highlight">{{ block.settings.heading_highlight }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </h2>

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-company-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-stat-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat_1_number }}</div>
            <div class="ai-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat_1_label }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-stat-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat_2_number }}</div>
            <div class="ai-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat_2_label }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-testimonial-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.show_quote_icon %}
        <svg class="ai-quote-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path d="M3 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.756-2.017-2-2H4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2 1 0 1 0 1 1v1c0 1-1 2-2 2s-1 .008-1 1.031V20c0 1 0 1 1 1z"></path>
          <path d="M15 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.757-2.017-2-2h-4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2h.75c0 2.25.25 4-2.75 4v3c0 1 0 1 1 1z"></path>
        </svg>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ai-testimonial-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-testimonial-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-track>
          {% for i in (1..10) %}
            {% liquid
              assign enabled_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_enabled'
              assign image_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_image'
              assign name_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_name'
              assign position_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_position'
              assign company_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_company'
              assign text_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_text'

              assign enabled = block.settings[enabled_key]
              assign image = block.settings[image_key]
              assign name = block.settings[name_key]
              assign position = block.settings[position_key]
              assign company = block.settings[company_key]
              assign text = block.settings[text_key]
            %}

            {% if enabled %}
              <div class="ai-testimonial-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slide>
                <div class="ai-testimonial-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ image | image_url: width: 128 }}"
                      alt="{{ name | escape }}"
                      class="ai-customer-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      width="64"
                      height="64"
                      loading="lazy"
                    >
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="ai-customer-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                        <path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/>
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}
                  <div class="ai-customer-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% if name != blank %}
                      <div class="ai-customer-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ name }}</div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if position != blank or company != blank %}
                      <div class="ai-customer-position-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                        {% if position != blank %}{{ position }}{% endif %}
                        {% if position != blank and company != blank %} • {% endif %}
                        {% if company != blank %}{{ company }}{% endif %}
                      </div>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                </div>

                {% if text != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-testimonial-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ text }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_navigation %}
        <div class="ai-navigation-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <button class="ai-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-prev aria-label="Previous testimonial">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <button class="ai-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-next aria-label="Next testimonial">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</testimonial-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class TestimonialCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
        this.isHovered = false;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-track]');
        this.slides = this.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]');
        this.prevButton = this.querySelector('[data-prev]');
        this.nextButton = this.querySelector('[data-next]');
        this.autoplayEnabled = {{ block.settings.enable_autoplay | json }};
        this.autoplaySpeed = {{ block.settings.autoplay_speed | times: 1000 }};

        if (this.slides.length === 0) return;

        this.slides[0].classList.add('active');
        this.setupEventListeners();

        if (this.autoplayEnabled) {
          this.startAutoplay();
        }
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        if (this.prevButton) {
          this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.prev());
        }

        if (this.nextButton) {
          this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.next());
        }

        this.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
          this.isHovered = true;
          if (this.autoplayEnabled) {
            this.stopAutoplay();
          }
        });

        this.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
          this.isHovered = false;
          if (this.autoplayEnabled) {
            this.startAutoplay();
          }
        });

        let touchStartX = 0;
        let touchEndX = 0;

        this.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
          touchStartX = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
        });

        this.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
          touchEndX = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
          if (touchStartX - touchEndX > 50) {
            this.next();
          } else if (touchEndX - touchStartX > 50) {
            this.prev();
          }
        });
      }

      goToSlide(index) {
        this.slides[this.currentIndex].classList.remove('active');
        this.currentIndex = index;
        this.slides[this.currentIndex].classList.add('active');
        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(-${this.currentIndex * 100}%)`;
      }

      next() {
        const nextIndex = (this.currentIndex + 1) % this.slides.length;
        this.goToSlide(nextIndex);
      }

      prev() {
        const prevIndex = (this.currentIndex - 1 + this.slides.length) % this.slides.length;
        this.goToSlide(prevIndex);
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
        this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
          if (!this.isHovered) {
            this.next();
          }
        }, this.autoplaySpeed);
      }

      stopAutoplay() {
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
          this.autoplayInterval = null;
        }
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
      }
    }

    customElements.define('testimonial-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', TestimonialCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Premium testimonials",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#0B0B0D"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_top",
      "label": "Top spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 8,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 8,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_border_radius",
      "label": "Card border radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 28
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Company card"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "company_card_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#111111"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "badge_text",
      "label": "Badge text",
      "default": "Technology"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "badge_text_color",
      "label": "Badge text color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "badge_icon_color",
      "label": "Badge icon color",
      "default": "#4A9EFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
